{"text":"Okay, are you sure? We'll do it then. Um, I will do this poem, which is called In This Place, an American Lyric. It's a poem that I recited around two years ago at the Library of Congress. Um, oh thank you. I think my biology teacher started that applause. That's how you know you've made strides. But what was super interesting about writing this poem was I got so much feedback, which was like people telling me not to make it political. And I just remember being on that phone call and wanting to laugh, because everything is political, especially poetry. And I'd rather be seen as too political than being a bystander on the wrong side of time. So I was like, forget that. So I wrote this poem and I did it, and I know they were all scared that Trump was going to hear about it the next day, and I could not care less. It's called In This Place, an American Lyric. Also imagine that you were in the Library of Congress with me.","words":[{"text":"Okay","start":1.16,"end":1.84,"punct":","},{"text":"are","start":1.84,"end":2.52},{"text":"you","start":2.52,"end":2.56},{"text":"sure","start":2.56,"end":2.76,"punct":"?"},{"text":"We'll","start":3.7,"end":3.88},{"text":"do","start":3.88,"end":4.02},{"text":"it","start":4.02,"end":4.16},{"text":"then","start":4.16,"end":4.9,"punct":"."},{"text":"Um","start":7.54,"end":8.22,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":8.22,"end":8.9},{"text":"will","start":8.9,"end":9.04},{"text":"do","start":9.04,"end":9.32},{"text":"this","start":9.32,"end":9.96},{"text":"poem","start":9.96,"end":10.44,"punct":","},{"text":"which","start":11.14,"end":11.48},{"text":"is","start":11.48,"end":11.62},{"text":"called","start":11.62,"end":11.88},{"text":"In","start":11.88,"end":12.14},{"text":"This","start":12.14,"end":12.32},{"text":"Place","start":12.32,"end":12.72,"punct":","},{"text":"an","start":12.88,"end":12.98},{"text":"American","start":12.98,"end":13.48},{"text":"Lyric","start":13.48,"end":13.9,"punct":"."},{"text":"It's","start":14.26,"end":14.42